messages.content:
The eternal question. Older than some cathedrals. Flexbox on the parent:

.parent {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

That centres it both ways. Give the parent a height, mind, or there's nothing to centre it in.

.parent {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
}

Two lines. Grid's the smug one in the family. Same result, half the words.
